+## Worker settings
+
+The worker sends each unreturned loan one due-soon notice once its due date is between tomorrow and
+`Notices:DueSoonDays` days from today (a whole number of days). The default is 1, the day before;
+the worker's `appsettings.Development.json` sets 2 so reminders are easier to see locally. Override it
+per environment like any other setting, e.g. `Notices__DueSoonDays=3`.
+
